    "text": "Champions League 2018 Nagoya was held at Fukiage Hall in Nagoya on 21 March 2018, one of the 2018 season's four tournaments, whose top finishers earned Championship Points toward the World Championships and the season's rewards. Its top finishers in each league won Victory Decoration, with the year and the city in the foil, in a print for their place: Champion, 2nd Place, or 3rd Place for both the third and fourth.",
